    "policy": {
      "content": "Four publisher-authored body blocks in source order, omit third-party quotes, photo captions, navigation and links outside prose. Normalize visible whitespace. Staff/publisher attribution checked at source. Agency terms and federal government works under §§101 and 105; no third-party assets downloaded.",
      "controls": "Whole paragraph and one sentence splices use exact source-linked material from the same feature. The part outside the target interval stays fixed. These are controlled substitutions, not independently collected editor revisions.",
      "documents": "Six dated web feature source documents. One source group per article and no split between authors or source variants in development/confirmation. NASA and NOAA each provide two features; genre and publisher samples are clustered.",
      "novelty": "Exact normalized 12-token history and within-holdout screening. Prior exposure and pretraining beyond available receipts is unknown."
    },
